cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use ed521rs in an audit or in research, please cite it as below.
title: "ed521rs: fast Ed521 signature verification"
abstract: >-
  Fast verification of Ed521 signatures (EdDSA over the Edwards curve E-521, ICP-Brasil
  DOC-ICP-01.01) in Rust, with Python bindings, built for auditing the files signed by
  Brazil's TSE voting machines.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Medeiros
    given-names: Tacio
repository-code: https://github.com/tacio/ed521rs
url: https://docs.rs/ed521
license: MIT
version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-11-08
keywords:
  - ed521
  - eddsa
  - e-521
  - digital signature
  - election audit
  - icp-brasil
